<title>JAPAN: Brunei sets Dec Seria Light at $25.25 -- traders.</title>
<headline>Brunei sets Dec Seria Light at $25.25 -- traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has set the price of its benchmark Seria Light crude oil for December at $25.25 per barrel, down 95 cents from November, oil traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The December price for Brunei's Champion crude was set at $25.05, also down 95 cents from the previous month, they said.</p>
<p>Brunei has set a provisional price of $25.80 for January Seria Light and $25.60 for January Champion crude.</p>
</text>
